# Dust Animus: "If you control five or more untapped lands, this creature enters with two +1/+1 counters and a lifelink counter on it"
# (CR 614.1c, 122.1b). Bot1 plays a Plains each of turns 1, 3, 5, 7 and 9; on turn 9 the five Plains are all untapped (exactly the limit)
# and the Animus is paid for with Mox Pearl and Mox Jet (artifacts, not lands), so it enters a 4/5 with two +1/+1 counters, a lifelink counter
# and flying. Turn 11: it attacks for 4 and the lifelink counter gains 4 (Bot1 20 to 24, Bot2 20 to 16).

